  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Deal Knowledge Hub - Water and Circular Economy, Forest and Biodiversity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action entitled &#xbf;Green Deal Knowledge Hub &#xbf; Water and Circular Economy, Forest, and Biodiversity&#xbf; will provide high-level expertise and knowledge to accelerate the transition to inclusive greener, low-carbon, resilient and environmentally sustainable development in partner countries. &amp;nbsp;The initiative will support a new phase of the Green Deal Knowledge Hub and the provision of services through the implementation of three Technical Assistance Facilities (TAF) in the areas of water and circular economy, forest, and biodiversity.</narrative>
  </description>
